# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live Google reviews — SERVER-SIDE ONLY.
# Read by /api/reviews.js (Vercel serverless function) and by the local
# Vite dev middleware. Never prefix with VITE_, otherwise the key would be
# bundled into the public JavaScript.
#
# Without a key the site still works and shows the bundled reviews.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → enable "Places API (New)"
# → Credentials → Create API key → restrict it to "Places API (New)"
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Optional — already defaults to SMK Automobiles, Sundakkamuthur
# GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=ChIJ14jcSqpbqDsRzL-THQhBOOE
